  "body": "As registerProtocolHandler() is essentially a user permission, it's not clear to me that it makes sense to let the site manage these after the fact. It also doesn't seem likely that a site would (be able to) cleanup as it takes the service down. So I'm a bit hesitant to endorse adding this to Firefox.\r\n\r\nI am curious to hear what other people think.\r\n\r\ncc @ericlaw1979 @fred-wang",
